gaf3(){return"The rings around the buttons show fullness, mood, grooming and energy. Food costs coins, while playing and grooming are word mini-games. Studying uses energy, and it recovers on its own."},
gaf2(){return"Level and XP"},
gaf1(){return"You earn XP for learned words and completed exercises. Collect enough and you level up."},
gaeY(){return"Coins and streak"},
gaeX(){return"Coins are rewards for tasks and lessons \u2014 spend them on cat food. The flame shows how many days in a row all daily tasks were done."},
gafo(){return"Word cards"},
gafn(){return'Tap a card to flip it. Swipe left for "I know", right for "Still learning". A word you know comes back once more with translation options: pick the right one and swipe the card left \u2014 the word is learned.'},
gafm(){return"Daily tasks"},
gafl(){return"Every day: learn new words, finish a lesson, feed, play with and groom your cat. Each task pays coins, and tapping a task opens it right away."},
gafg(){return"Your profile"},
gaff(){return"Tap your avatar to open your profile: stats, achievements and all your learned words to review. You can also sign in there so your progress is never lost."},
